# 2026-11-04 ISO-TP 流控/异常自测（当前版本）

命令：

```bash
make test
# 或直接：
./selftest
```

输出：

```text
{"case":"7B   BS0/ST0","ok":true,"b_rx":2,"a_tx":3,"fc":0,"cf":0}
{"case":"100B BS0/ST0","ok":true,"b_rx":2,"a_tx":3,"fc":1,"cf":14}
{"case":"1024B BS0/ST0","ok":true,"b_rx":2,"a_tx":3,"fc":1,"cf":146}
{"case":"4095B BS0/ST0","ok":true,"b_rx":2,"a_tx":3,"fc":1,"cf":585}
{"case":"1024B BS8/ST5","ok":true,"b_rx":2,"a_tx":3,"fc":19,"cf":146}
{"case":"4095B BS8/ST5","ok":true,"b_rx":2,"a_tx":3,"fc":74,"cf":585}
{"case":"100B 丢最后CF","ok":true,"b_rx":3,"a_tx":3,"fc":2,"cf":14}
{"case":"100B 错序CF#2","ok":true,"b_rx":4,"a_tx":5,"fc":2,"cf":2}
{"case":"100B 丢FC","ok":true,"b_rx":3,"a_tx":4,"fc":1,"cf":0}
```

覆盖：

- BS=0 / STmin=0；
- BS=8 / STmin=5ms，校验 FC 数量和块内 CF 间隔；
- 1024 / 4095 字节；
- 丢最后一个 CF → N_Cr 超时；
- CF#2 错序 → ABORT + OVFLW；
- 丢 FC → N_Bs 超时；
- FC 数量：BS=8 时 1024B 为 19，4095B 为 74。

状态枚举：

```text
RX: 0=IDLE 1=CF 2=DONE 3=TIMEOUT 4=ABORT
TX: 0=IDLE 1=WAIT_FC 2=CF 3=DONE 4=TIMEOUT 5=ABORT
```
